   <h3> new blood...</h3>
   <p>
   
<ul>
<li><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=415&lastnode_id=2863">Front Page</a>
</ul>




<table border=0 width=100% cellspacing=0>
<tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white>new blood...</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1744&lastnode_id=2863">Dizeez</a> on 2002-02-28 10:30:19</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>  A dark trio set up camp near a halfling village in the murk of the Nektulos Forrest, boasting of the trophies they will carry home. The two young Tier Dal  resemble each other close enough to be twins, while the hulking troll strikes a disturbing contrast to the eerily handsome youths.<br>
 <br>
  Unnoticed by the three, a dusty skeleton shambles by, grinning to itself. Upon passing out of sight the decaying creature stops and seems to make outline a mystic symbol in the air. Slowly, the flesh creeps and crawls from the earth, coalescing into the form of a familiar Necromancer. Watching from beyond the rise, the Haggard looking Dark Elf watches the three and, nodding his approval, steps into the shadows and dissapears. </td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

<tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2864&lastnode_id=2863">Re: new blood...</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=781&lastnode_id=2863">Inertia</a> on 2002-03-01 15:09:25</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>The haggard Dark Elf does not notice that from behind, a pair of eyes watches him as well.  As the eyes take in the quaint little scene, a Leatherfoot Medic out on his duties smells the blood of the three young ones.  He whispers to himself "Curse those heathen, I'll soon have their hide, as soon as that Necromancer has left"  The smelly thing creeps up to just behind the tired looking man.  What none of them hears is the almost silent approach of an air elemental, guided by the dark Mage's eyes.  The Leatherfoot is startled, but only for a moment.  There is a quick snap and then the ragged body is devoured ravenously by the cruel beast.<br>
<P><br>
The minor annoyance removed, the Mage can now pay close attention to the trio.  They fight well together and seem to bond in friendship.  She laughs to herself as the two young Tier'Dal playfully splash Halfling blood at the Troll, who squeals with delight.  Ah to be so young again!  The dark Mage can see why the Necromancer is pleased.  The dark Mistress smiles to herself.  She is pleased as well.<br>
<P><br>
She waves to her elemental, beckoning it to follow her to the ruins of the druid rings.  Her pet needs to feed some more....</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2865&lastnode_id=2863">Re: new blood...</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2232&lastnode_id=2863">Tamyanie</a> on 2002-03-02 11:21:13</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Four figures surround the trio as they look around the ruins.  It has been desided that the smallest will grab the priest, the two oldest will grab the troll knight and the last will grab what seems to be the priest's brother.<br>
<br>
They slowly creep forward and when the trio are separated they attack.  The two brothers take down their attackers a little to easily.  The two attacking the troll laugh as he starts swinging them around. The oldest laughs "Broodil stop I think I am going to be sick!"<br>
<br>
As she's dropped to the ground she laughs at two youngest attackers. "Darksiide! Serpentis! Get off my sisters!"<br>
<br>
The sister's drop the bags of food they brought and sit down with their old friends.  Broodil the troll Knight, Darksiide the priest and Serpentis the Knight, Meilina, Tamyanie, Kinru and Nila eat and talk for hours about past battles and mischief that the seven have caused together and apart.<br>
<br>
Tamyanie looks at the men and smiles sadly. "It has been to long since we have fought together...may that end today."</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2866&lastnode_id=2863">Re: new blood...</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2700&lastnode_id=2863">Aerden</a> on 2002-03-02 14:14:02</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>In the darkness of the nearby shadows, a figure, hardly visible to even the most trained eye, looks upon the spectacle. He puts up a grin as he hears the sweet snapping sound, the sound he heard so often, the sound he has come to worship.<br>
<br>
After a while, he just nods to himself, and continues to walk the shadows of Norrath, in search for prey.<br>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2867&lastnode_id=2863">Re: new blood...</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=2502&lastnode_id=2863">Ebonray</a> on 2002-03-02 15:40:49</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>A studious Necromancer  Boldly  sits among  the shadowed men in Nektulos  watching  the scenes unfold before him as he takes notes.. he is Pleased with the strenght and Brutality.. * what's this *  as he spies another shadowed form with a floating  beastial  by her side .. the studious Necromancer  tries  to blend in more with the shadowed .. and watches silently ..... Proudly .. !</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>
</table>
